---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Terms of Service | Plokr" description="The terms governing your use of Plokr." noIndex={false}>
  <header class="phero">
    <div class="wrap-xs" style="padding:0 56px">
      <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
      <h1 style="font-size:44px">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="lede" style="font-size:16px;margin-top:14px">Last updated April 1, 2026</p>
      <div class="legaltabs">
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>
        <a href="/terms" class="on">Terms</a>
        <a href="/dpa">DPA</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>
  <article class="sec" style="padding-top:48px">
    <div class="wrap-xs">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your access to and use of Plokr Sdn. Bhd. (Registration No. 202601028423 (1690518-P)), a company incorporated in Malaysia ("Plokr", "we") products and services. By creating an account or using Plokr, you agree to these Terms.</p>
        <h2>1. The service</h2>
        <p>Plokr provides engineering observability software that connects to your project management and source control tools. We display insights derived from that data. We do not change your code or make commits, and we do not retain your source code after an audit finishes.</p>
        <h2>2. Your account</h2>
        <p>You must provide accurate registration information and keep your credentials secure. You are responsible for all activity that occurs under your account. Notify us immediately at <a href="mailto:security@plokr.com">security@plokr.com</a> if you suspect unauthorized access.</p>
        <h2>3. Acceptable use</h2>
        <p>You may not use Plokr to: (a) violate any applicable law; (b) attempt to gain unauthorized access to our systems or other users' workspaces; (c) reverse-engineer, decompile, or extract our software; (d) resell or sublicense the service without written permission; or (e) transmit malicious code or interfere with the service's integrity.</p>
        <h2>4. Subscriptions and payment</h2>
        <p>Paid plans (Individual and Team) are billed monthly or annually as selected; Team is billed per seat. All fees are exclusive of applicable taxes. Subscriptions renew automatically unless cancelled before the renewal date. Refunds are not provided for partial periods except where required by law.</p>
        <h2>5. Free trial</h2>
        <p>Every plan starts with a 7-day free trial. The trial requires a valid card. The stored card is charged automatically when the trial ends unless you cancel the trial before then. If a charge fails, you have 7 days to update your card before your workspace is locked for runs and scans. Nothing is deleted while a workspace is locked. We reserve the right to modify or discontinue free trials at any time.</p>
        <h2>6. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>Plokr and its content are owned by Plokr Sdn. Bhd. and protected by intellectual property laws. These Terms grant you a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable license to use the service for your internal business purposes. You retain ownership of your data.</p>
        <h2>7. Data and privacy</h2>
        <p>Your use of the service is also governed by our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>. For customers subject to data processing requirements, our <a href="/dpa">Data Processing Addendum</a> (DPA) is incorporated into these Terms upon execution.</p>
        <h2>8. Warranties and disclaimers</h2>
        <p>THE SERVICE IS PROVIDED "AS IS" WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED. WE DO NOT WARRANT THAT THE SERVICE WILL BE UNINTERRUPTED, ERROR-FREE, OR FREE OF HARMFUL COMPONENTS. YOUR USE IS AT YOUR SOLE RISK.</p>
        <h2>9. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, PLOKR'S TOTAL LIABILITY FOR ANY CLAIM ARISING UNDER THESE TERMS SHALL NOT EXCEED THE AMOUNT YOU PAID US IN THE TWELVE MONTHS PRECEDING THE CLAIM. IN NO EVENT SHALL WE BE LIABLE FOR INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES.</p>
        <h2>10. Termination</h2>
        <p>Either party may terminate these Terms at any time. We may suspend or terminate your access immediately if you breach these Terms. On termination, your right to use the service ceases and we will delete your data within 30 days per our Privacy Policy.</p>
        <h2>11. Governing law</h2>
        <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of Delaware, USA, without regard to conflict-of-law principles. Any disputes shall be resolved in the courts of Delaware, and you consent to personal jurisdiction there.</p>
        <h2>12. Changes to these Terms</h2>
        <p>We may update these Terms from time to time. We will notify you of material changes by email or in-app notice at least 14 days before they take effect. Continued use after the effective date constitutes acceptance.</p>
        <h2>13. Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about these Terms? Email <a href="mailto:legal@plokr.com">legal@plokr.com</a> or write to Plokr Sdn. Bhd., 50-3 Jalan Metro Pudu, Fraser Business Park, 55100 Kuala Lumpur, Wilayah Persekutuan Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia.</p>
